Public availability is not a grant of missing rights. This release does not
authorize commercial use or further redistribution where those rights have not
been established. Modifications do not automatically remove upstream terms.

The original release scripts have separate MIT terms in LICENSE-CODE.txt.
Those code terms do not cover the dataset, upstream notices, model weights or
other third-party content. This file must not be treated as a dataset-wide MIT
